        "paragraph_id": "7AEF9F48",
        "text": "Horizontal infiltration and exfiltration (keyword: gwhorinfil = 1) is computed across the numerical vertical interface between the groundwater domain and the surface water domain in adjoining cells. The direction of exchange is determined by the head gradient, and the bed level slope direction:"
